# Cabinet Core: the one build setting (T-CC1a F1).
# Cabinet Core holds no database key: it runs only inside Joinery Core and talks
# to it through Joinery Core's own client (/js/api-client.js).
#
# The public storage host of the hardware models (hinges, runners). The old
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL is still read second until the variable is renamed on Vercel.
VITE_HARDWARE_STORAGE_URL=
